<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God’s merciful compassions</l><l>In Jesus Christ appear,</l><l>Exper’enced every morning,</l><l>Dissolving all my fear;</l><l>The Father of compassions</l><l>And God of comfort gives</l><l>To me His loving essence</l><l>And in my spirit lives.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God’s faithfulness is greater</l><l>Than all my faithlessness;</l><l>His nature and His being</l><l>Became my blessedness;</l><l>His calling and His keeping</l><l>In Christ the Son, so sweet,</l><l>Will sanctify me wholly,</l><l>And will preserve complete.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
